seek-v4.1 ，kimi-k3 ，qwen3.8max 0.19 倍率。Grok Heavy 倍率 0.19 ，gpt-image-2.5 一毛钱一张。<br /><br />吉吉 API （不降智）中转站 售后 3 群：1097611338", "last_modified": 1789785281, "replies": 47, "id": 1243121}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24376, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3741, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 386672, "username": "qwqqwq", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/qwqqwq", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_mini.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_normal.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_large.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_xlarge.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_xxlarge.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_xxxlarge.png?m=1755242220", "created": 1551011548, "last_modified": 1755242220, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "nofishing", "last_touched": 1789815730, "title": "工资越高是不是工作越轻松", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243077", "created": 1789741843, "deleted": 0, "content": "月薪 4-5W 的应该比 1-2W 的轻松点吧，基本就是开开会啥的，这种基本都是管理领导之类的\n\n1-2W 的干的活应该是最多的，体力和脑力的那种，不知道制造业是不是挺多这种的\n\n互联网体力工作应该很少，主要是脑力劳动和沟通占的多吧\n\n还是管理和领导舒服啊，工资高还不累", "content_rendered": "<p>月薪 4-5W 的应该比 1-2W 的轻松点吧，基本就是开开会啥的，这种基本都是管理领导之类的</p>\n<p>1-2W 的干的活应该是最多的，体力和脑力的那种，不知道制造业是不是挺多这种的</p>\n<p>互联网体力工作应该很少，主要是脑力劳动和沟通占的多吧</p>\n<p>还是管理和领导舒服啊，工资高还不累</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789779023, "replies": 42, "id": 1243077}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 241712, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4518, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 799342, "username": "ldy619354397", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/ldy619354397", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/db8b/e417/799342_mini.png?m=1782457677", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/db8b/e417/799342_normal.png?m=1782457677", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/db8b/e417/799342_large.png?m=1782457677", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/db8b/e417/799342_xlarge.png?m=1782457677", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/db8b/e417/799342_xxlarge.png?m=1782457677", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/db8b/e417/799342_xxxlarge.png?m=1782457677", "created": 1775121831, "last_modified": 1782457677, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "nsjs", "last_touched": 1789822811, "title": "有什么比较好的方案让 AI 实现 24 小时自动化开发？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243154", "created": 1789802235, "deleted": 0, "content": "复杂任务 AI 动不动执行要 1~2 个小时，人不可能一直坐在电脑旁等结果，有没比较好的方案能让 AI 实现 24 小时自动化开发，并且可以设定哪个 AI 负责验收和补充，哪个 AI 负责开发。以及 5 个小时额度耗尽，会自动等 5 小时额度恢复继续执行任务？", "content_rendered": "<p>复杂任务 AI 动不动执行要 1~2 个小时，人不可能一直坐在电脑旁等结果，有没比较好的方案能让 AI 实现 24 小时自动化开发，并且可以设定哪个 AI 负责验收和补充，哪个 AI 负责开发。以及 5 个小时额度耗尽，会自动等 5 小时额度恢复继续执行任务？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789802235, "replies": 36, "id": 1243154}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "/static/img/node_default_large.png", "name": "solodeveloper", "avatar_normal": "/static/img/node_default_normal.png", "title": "独立开发", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/solodeveloper", "topics": 1, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "独立开发", "avatar_mini": "/static/img/node_default_mini.png", "stars": 1, "founder_id": 789455, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1376, "parent_node_name": null}, "member": {"id": 651160, "username": "EricYuan1", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/EricYuan1", "website": "https://launch-x-website.vercel.app", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_mini.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_normal.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_large.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_xlarge.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_xxlarge.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_xxxlarge.png?m=1786883813", "created": 1695729715, "last_modified": 1786883813, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "hjyj98358", "last_touched": 1789824209, "title": "看图，好像确实是这样子", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243104", "created": 1789780666, "deleted": 0, "content": "自从 AI 出来后，包括我自己，也是兴致冲冲的开发了 [Launchx 来](<https://github.com/twotwoba/LaunchX>)自用，好像是个人都能指挥 AI 开发出自己的产品。\n\n![]( https://i.imgur.com/bvnsux6.jpeg)\n\n我不否认，AI 在企业级项目上还不能做到很完美，但是工具类的东西，几乎没有不能完成的。\n\n就说 V2EX 的 ios 客户端吧，v 站上就看到了很多个，挨个用下来过，现在我个人感觉最好用的就是 Vex （非广告，我是早期用户），它让我感觉好的设计与用户体验也许能让产品存活下来。\n\n但是，我又思考了一个问题：设计与用户体验是 AI 最容易复刻的！如何才能保证产品的竞争力呢？\n\n独立开发者要怎么做才能在这个 AI 时代立足呢？", "content_rendered": "<p>自从 AI 出来后，包括我自己，也是兴致冲冲的开发了 <a href=\"https://github.com/twotwoba/LaunchX\" rel=\"nofollow\">Launchx 来</a>自用，好像是个人都能指挥 AI 开发出自己的产品。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bvnsux6.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p>我不否认，AI 在企业级项目上还不能做到很完美，但是工具类的东西，几乎没有不能完成的。</p>\n<p>就说 V2EX 的 ios 客户端吧，v 站上就看到了很多个，挨个用下来过，现在我个人感觉最好用的就是 Vex （非广告，我是早期用户），它让我感觉好的设计与用户体验也许能让产品存活下来。</p>\n<p>但是，我又思考了一个问题：设计与用户体验是 AI 最容易复刻的！如何才能保证产品的竞争力呢？</p>\n<p>独立开发者要怎么做才能在这个 AI 时代立足呢？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789780666, "replies": 34, "id": 1243104}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 73425, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9785, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 666335, "username": "TrackBack", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/TrackBack", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/33c6b285c23c89c9711033aa6bf64d99?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/33c6b285c23c89c9711033aa6bf64d99?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/33c6b285c23c89c9711033aa6bf64d99?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1702196047, "last_modified": 1774671532, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "hjyj98358", "last_touched": 1789824272, "title": "2026 年到底还有哪个模型能正常说人话的？不需要能力多强", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243125", "created": 1789786533, "deleted": 0, "content": "从今年开始感觉所有模型都 Coding 特化了，虽然每次许愿许得很开心，但是偶尔要讨论一下的时候就很烦，字里行间都充斥着奇怪的用词，语法和停顿，根本看不进去\r\n\r\nGPT 就不说了，不说人话被诟病很久了；\r\nA 家的稍微好一点，但是太贵，而且从 4.7 开始也渐渐不太类人了；\r\ngrok 和 glm 感觉专门针对代码训的，丝毫不考虑交流，上来就是一堆拽拽的专业名词，搜一下根本没人在用，也不知道是不是模型自造的；\r\nDeepSeek 本来一直都还挺好，我都拿来把别的模型的输出翻译一遍，但是这次 0910 更新之后也开始不说人话了，还没地方能调旧版，也是没招了", "content_rendered": "<p>从今年开始感觉所有模型都 Coding 特化了，虽然每次许愿许得很开心，但是偶尔要讨论一下的时候就很烦，字里行间都充斥着奇怪的用词，语法和停顿，根本看不进去</p>\n<p>GPT 就不说了，不说人话被诟病很久了；\nA 家的稍微好一点，但是太贵，而且从 4.7 开始也渐渐不太类人了；\ngrok 和 glm 感觉专门针对代码训的，丝毫不考虑交流，上来就是一堆拽拽的专业名词，搜一下根本没人在用，也不知道是不是模型自造的；\nDeepSeek 本来一直都还挺好，我都拿来把别的模型的输出翻译一遍，但是这次 0910 更新之后也开始不说人话了，还没地方能调旧版，也是没招了</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789786533, "replies": 27, "id": 1243125}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/8cb2/2bdd/406_large.png?m=1636150954", "name": "reddit", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/8cb2/2bdd/406_normal.png?m=1636150954", "title": "Reddit", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/reddit", "topics": 83, "footer": "", "header": "Reddit, stylized as reddit, is a social news and entertainment website where registered users submit content in the form of either a link or a text (\"self\") post.", "title_alternative": "Reddit", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/8cb2/2bdd/406_mini.png?m=1636150954", "stars": 487, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 406, "parent_node_name": "internet"}, "member": {"id": 202934, "username": "chiva", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/chiva", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a4523f047ced49830245fc5d7c8646b7?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a4523f047ced49830245fc5d7c8646b7?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a4523f047ced49830245fc5d7c8646b7?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1480055841, "last_modified": 1480055841, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "weiyunjun", "last_touched": 1789823668, "title": "现在 reddit 太难养号了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243138", "created": 1789796687, "deleted": 0, "content": "现在 reddit 太难养号了，干了两个月了 karma 还是 1 。", "content_rendered": "<p>现在 reddit 太难养号了，干了两个月了 karma 还是 1 。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789796687, "replies